# Copy this file to .streamlit/secrets.toml and fill in real values.
# Only needed for a future Streamlit Cloud deploy. On the local VM the app
# runs with zero owner-supplied keys (SenseNova via stored credential,
# text mode fully working, edge-tts keyless).
